  "question": {
    "text": "The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math> and the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> terms of an arithmetic progression are, respectively <math><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>77</mn></math>. If the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term of the given arithmetic progression is <math><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>17</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>K</mi></math> is"
